---
// The white curved sweep across the bottom-right corner of a page banner,
// taken from the inner pages of the old Karrota-built site ("Historia jonë",
// "Recetat"; Karrota portfolio screenshots, Sep 2024). On those, a white
// shape rose from about two-thirds of the way along the banner's bottom edge
// to its top-right corner: shallow at first, then steep.
//
// Place it inside the banner (which must be position: relative and
// overflow: hidden), after the photo and its shade and before the text. It
// then paints over the photo and under the text, with no z-index involved.
//
// `fill` must match whatever sits directly below the banner, so the sweep
// reads as the page rising into the photo.
import '../styles/classic-banners.css';

const { fill = '#fff' } = Astro.props;
---

<svg
  class="banner-swoosh"
  viewBox="0 0 100 100"
  preserveAspectRatio="none"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
  style={`--swoosh-fill: ${fill}`}
>
  <path d="M0 100C45 100 88 74 100 2V100Z" />
</svg>
